  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Program for the Implementation of the National Financial Inclusion Strategy of Argentina</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Programa para la implementacin de la Estrategia Nacional de Inclusin Financiera de Argentina</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To contribute to increased financial service access and use for households and businesses through: (i) implementation of the National Financial Inclusion Strategy; and (ii) increased access to credit for micro and small enterprises (MSEs)</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">contribuir a incrementar el acceso y uso de servicios financieros para hogares y empresas a travs de: (i) implementar la Estrategia Nacional de Inclusin Financiera; e (ii) incrementar el acceso a crdito de Micro y Pequeas Empresas (MyPE).</narrative>
  </description>
